contentText:
Sir Rod Stewart is giving fans a reassuring update after a pair of canceled shows. Unfortunately, though, he&#8217;ll need to stay off the road for the next four weeks as he recovers from a recent heart procedure.

The Rock & Roll Hall of Famer has successfully undergone a routine coronary stent procedure and is &#8220;very much on the mend,&#8221; according to a statement provided to Billboard on Tuesday (Aug. 11).

